(The heads of our subject which remain for our consideration this) Tj T*
(evening are, you will remember, the accumulation and the distribution) Tj T*
(of works of art. Our complete inquiry fell into four divisions--first,) Tj T*
(how to get our genius; then, how to apply our genius; then, how to) Tj T*
(accumulate its results; and lastly, how to distribute them. We) Tj T*
(considered, last evening, how to discover and apply it;--we have) Tj T*
(to-night to examine the modes of its preservation and distribution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
