(chances of destruction. But the question is not a merely arithmetical) Tj T*
(one of this kind. Your fragments of broken admirations will not, when) Tj T*
(they are put together, make up one whole admiration; two and two, in) Tj T*
(this case, do not make four, nor anything like four. Your good) Tj T*
(picture, or book, or work of art of any kind, is always in some degree) Tj T*
(fenced and closed about with difficulty. You may think of it as of a) Tj T*
(kind of cocoa-nut, with very often rather an unseemly shell, but good) Tj T*
