(single scratch with the point of your knife to the shell of each, you) Tj T*
(will get no milk from all the twenty. But if you leave nineteen of) Tj T*
(them alone, and give twenty cuts to the shell of one, you will get) Tj T*
(through it, and at the milk of it. And the tendency of the human mind) Tj T*
