(redundance; which may of course by active persons be made available) Tj T*
(in preparation for future work or future profit; in which function) Tj T*
(riches have generally received the name of capital; that is to say, of) Tj T*
(head- or source-material. The business of the economist is to show how) Tj T*
(this provision may be a Distant one.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
