(persons or societies exchanging and the agent or agents of exchange:) Tj T*
(the value of the things to be exchanged is known by both the) Tj T*
(exchangers, and each receives equivalent value, neither gaining nor) Tj T*
(losing \(for whatever one gains the other loses\). The intermediate) Tj T*
(agent is paid an equal and known percentage by both, partly for labour) Tj T*
