(lightning, which,) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(            "begot but in a cloud,) Tj T*
(  Though shining bright, and speaking loud,) Tj T*
(  Whilst it begins, concludes its violent race,) Tj T*
(  And, where it gilds, it wounds the place;") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(or else as the lightning of the sacred sign, which shines from one) Tj T*
(part of the heaven to the other. There is no other choice; you must) Tj T*
(either take dust for deity, spectre for possession, fettered dream for) Tj T*
(life, and for epitaph, this reversed verse of the great Hebrew hymn of) Tj T*
(economy \(Psalm cxii.\):--"He hath gathered together, he hath stripped) Tj T*
(the poor, his iniquity remaineth for ever." Or else, having the sun) Tj T*
(for justice to shine on you, and the sincere substance of good in your) Tj T*
(possession, and the pure law and liberty of life within you, leave men) Tj T*
(to write this better legend over your grave: "He hath dispersed) Tj T*
(abroad. He hath given to the poor. His righteousness remaineth for) Tj T*
(ever.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(       *       *       *       *       *) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     The present paper completes the definitions necessary for) Tj T*
(     future service. The next in order will be the first chapter) Tj T*
(     of the body of the work.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     These introductory essays are as yet in imperfect form; I) Tj T*
(     suffer them to appear, though they were not intended for) Tj T*
(     immediate publication, for the sake of such chance service) Tj T*
(     as may be found in them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     [Here the author indicated certain corrections, which have) Tj T*
(     been carried out in this edition. He then went on to say) Tj T*
(     that the note on Charis \(p. 274\) required a word or two in) Tj T*
(     further illustration, as follows:--]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(     The derivation of words is like that of rivers: there is one) Tj T*
(     real source, usually small, unlikely, and difficult to find,) Tj T*
(     far up among the hills; then, as the word flows on and comes) Tj T*
(     into service, it takes in the force of other words from) Tj T*
(     other sources, and becomes itself quite another word--even) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
